            "description": "",
            "summary": "Medifast (MED) reported that earnings have fallen by 33.2% per year over the last five years, and the company now expects a sharp 146.7% annual earnings decline over the next three years. Revenue is forecast to decline by 12.5% per year through 2025, while net profit margin has slipped to 0.06% from last year\u2019s 1.1%. A notable one-off loss of $12.5 million in the most recent results highlights the impact of non-recurring items this year, increasing investor focus on the company\u2019s ongoing...",
